1
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:25,540
Christ is the image of God yet unseen

2
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:28,240
In Him God’s fullness dwells so serene

3
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,190
The perfect imprint of God’s very nature

4
00:00:31,190 --> 00:00:34,140
God’s glory shines, through Jesus the Savior

5
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:36,800
He is the God-Son above all creation

6
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,280
All things were made by, through and for Him

7
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:42,160
Sustaining the cosmos in full preservation

8
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:45,280
The word of His power shall never grow dim

9
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:48,840
Christ is supreme over all beings

10
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:51,140
God of glory, Lord of kings

11
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:54,200
Christ is supreme over all beings

12
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:59,030
Magnificent Savior, creation sings

13
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:07,830
Christ is supreme

14
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:13,440
We were his foes, suppressing his glory

15
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:16,250
Hostile and proud, rebellious, unworthy

16
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:18,740
Yet at the cross, he poured out his blood

17
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:21,460
Redeeming Shepherd, atoning his flock

18
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:24,270
The grave was defeated, he rose from the dead

19
00:01:24,270 --> 00:01:27,150
Now ruling from heaven, the church’s chief head

20
00:01:27,150 --> 00:01:29,890
Sovereignly reigning, unbeatable Lord

21
00:01:29,890 --> 00:01:33,280
Magnify Jesus, now and forever adored

22
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:36,680
Christ is supreme over all beings

